			(property "Description" "Generic NTC thermistor, 10k at 25C, 0402 (1005 metric). Murata NCP15XH103F03RC; B25/50=3380K, +/-1%, 100mW, -40..+125C. Default footprint cec-Resistor_SMD:NTC_0402_1005Metric (real Murata land + 3D, vendored from LCSC C77131); datasheet cached in lib/datasheets/. Wire as the lower/upper leg of a divider to an MCU ADC for board or connector temperature sensing."
